%feature("docstring") OT::SimulationSensitivityAnalysis::computeEventProbabilitySensitivity
R"RAW(Compute the sensitivity to the probability.

The sensitivity of the failure probability :math:`P_f = \mathbb{P}(\mathcal{F})` wrt the distribution parameters :math:`\theta` is written:

.. math::

    \vect{sens_{Pf}}_j = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^n \mathbf{1}_{\mathcal{F}}(\vect{X}_i) \frac{\partial \log f_{\theta}(\vect{X}_i)}{\partial \theta_j}

With importance sampling with weights :math:`w_i = f_{\theta}(\vect{X}_i)/h(\vect{X}_i)`:

.. math::

    \vect{sens_{Pf}}_j = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^n \mathbf{1}_{\mathcal{F}}(\vect{X}_i) \frac{\partial \log f_{\theta}(\vect{X}_i)}{\partial \theta_j} w_i

This sensitivity is supported only for independent inputs: the implementation
uses the marginal log-PDF gradients, which match the joint score only when the
inputs are independent.

Returns
-------
sensitivity_pf : :class:`~openturns.PointWithDescription`
    The probability sensitivity.
)RAW"

